Derived work
------------

modular-factory is derived from "Software Factory for Claude Code (v2)" by
ZazenCodes, released under the GPLv3:

  https://github.com/zazencodes/zazencodes-season-3/tree/main/src/software-factory-claude-code-v2

The job state handling, the checks gate, the merge flow, the cost calculation
and the agent prompts in core/roles/ started from that project's
factory/bin/job, factory/bin/gate, factory/bin/route and .claude/agents/*.md,
and were modified in 2026 for this project. docs/design.md lists what changed.
